---
import PilarLayout from "../layouts/PilarLayout.astro";
---
<PilarLayout
  title="Panduan Nifas 0-42 Hari: Perawatan: NurturaMom"
  description="Panduan nifas: lokia, perawatan luka, menyusui awal, nutrisi, dan kesehatan mental ibu."
  path="/nifas"
  breadcrumb="Nifas"
  headingEn="Postpartum"
  descEn="Postpartum guide: lochia, wound care, early breastfeeding, nutrition, and mom mental health."
  chips={["Lokia", "Luka jahitan", "Menyusui", "KB pasca salin", "Baby blues"]}
  chipsEn={["Lochia", "Stitch wounds", "Breastfeeding", "Postpartum FP", "Baby blues"]}
  danger="Segera periksa bila perdarahan membasahi lebih dari 1 pembalut per jam, demam di atas 38 derajat, nyeri perut hebat, ASI tersumbat plus demam, atau sedih berat lebih dari 2 minggu."
  dangerEn="Go promptly for soaking over 1 pad hourly, fever above 38 degrees, severe belly pain, blocked milk plus fever, or heavy sadness beyond 2 weeks."
  faqs={[
    { q: "Berapa lama perdarahan nifas normal?", a: "Lokia normal 2 sampai 6 minggu. Awal merah terang lalu berubah coklat dan kekuningan. Waspadai bila kembali merah segar dalam jumlah banyak." },
    { q: "Kapan boleh berhubungan lagi?", a: "Umumnya setelah 6 minggu dan luka sembuh, plus sudah kontrol. Diskusikan KB pasca salin dengan bidan sebelum 6 minggu." },
    { q: "Bagaimana bila payudara bengkak?", a: "Susui sesering mungkin 8 sampai 12 kali sehari. Kompres hangat sebelum menyusui dan kompres dingin setelahnya. Minta bantuan konselor laktasi bila demam." },
  ]}
  faqsEn={[
    { q: "How long is normal postpartum bleeding?", a: "Normal lochia lasts 2 to 6 weeks. Bright red first, then brown and yellowish. Watch for heavy fresh red return." },
    { q: "When can we be intimate again?", a: "Usually after 6 weeks with healed wounds, plus a checkup. Discuss postpartum family planning before 6 weeks." },
    { q: "What about engorged breasts?", a: "Nurse as often as possible, 8 to 12 times daily. Warm compress before, cold after. Ask a lactation counselor with fever." },
  ]}
>
  <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-[#2F2A2E]" data-en="Focus week by week">Fokus minggu per minggu</h2>
  <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#3D2B30]/80">
    <li data-en="Weeks 1-2. Rest enough. Keep wounds dry. Nurse on demand. Ask help for chores."><span class="font-bold text-[#58293A]">Minggu 1-2.</span> Istirahat cukup. Jaga luka tetap kering. Susui on demand. Minta bantuan untuk pekerjaan rumah.</li>
    <li data-en="Weeks 3-4. 10 minute relaxed walks if comfortable. Watch mood. Share fatigue with partner or family."><span class="font-bold text-[#58293A]">Minggu 3-4.</span> Jalan santai 10 menit bila nyaman. Pantau mood. Ceritakan lelah ke pasangan atau keluarga.</li>
    <li data-en="Weeks 5-6. Postpartum check. Discuss family planning, postpartum exercise, and activity plans."><span class="font-bold text-[#58293A]">Minggu 5-6.</span> Kontrol nifas. Bahas KB, senam nifas, dan rencana kembali aktivitas.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2 class="mt-7 text-lg font-extrabold text-[#2F2A2E]" data-en="Memorize these 8 danger signs">Tanda bahaya nifas: hafalkan 8 ini</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#3D2B30]/80" data-en="Most moms recover without issues. But these 8 signs must never wait. If even one appears, go to a facility the same day.">Sebagian besar ibu pulih tanpa masalah. Tapi 8 tanda di bawah tidak boleh ditunggu. Bila satu saja muncul, segera ke faskes hari itu juga.</p>
  <ol class="mt-3 space-y-2.5">
    <li class="flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-[#EFD0D6]/20 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#3D2B30]/85"><span class="grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#9C3D5C] text-xs font-bold text-white">1</span><span data-en="Heavy bleeding. Soaking over 1 pad hourly for 2 hours, egg sized clots, or sudden dizziness and paleness."><span class="font-bold text-[#76304A]">Perdarahan banyak.</span> Membasahi lebih dari 1 pembalut per jam selama 2 jam, gumpalan sebesar telur, atau pusing dan pucat mendadak.</span></li>
    <li class="flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-[#EFD0D6]/20 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#3D2B30]/85"><span class="grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#9C3D5C] text-xs font-bold text-white">2</span><span data-en="Fever above 38 degrees. Especially with chills, lower belly pain, or foul lochia. That signals infection."><span class="font-bold text-[#76304A]">Demam di atas 38 derajat.</span> Terutama disertai menggigil, nyeri perut bawah, atau cairan nifas berbau busuk. Itu tanda infeksi.</span></li>
    <li class="flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-[#EFD0D6]/20 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#3D2B30]/85"><span class="grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#9C3D5C] text-xs font-bold text-white">3</span><span data-en="Persistent severe belly pain. Mild cramps for 3 days are normal. Sharp unstopping pain needs a check."><span class="font-bold text-[#76304A]">Nyeri perut hebat menetap.</span> Kram ringan 3 hari pertama wajar. Nyeri tajam yang tidak reda perlu diperiksa.</span></li>
    <li class="flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-[#EFD0D6]/20 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#3D2B30]/85"><span class="grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#9C3D5C] text-xs font-bold text-white">4</span><span data-en="Swollen, pus filled, or smelly wounds. Applies to stitch and surgery wounds. Do not self treat with herbs."><span class="font-bold text-[#76304A]">Luka bengkak, bernanah, atau berbau.</span> Berlaku untuk luka jahitan maupun luka operasi. Jangan diobati sendiri dengan ramuan.</span></li>
    <li class="flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-[#EFD0D6]/20 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#3D2B30]/85"><span class="grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#9C3D5C] text-xs font-bold text-white">5</span><span data-en="Hard swollen breasts plus fever. That is mastitis. Keep nursing the sore side and get checked."><span class="font-bold text-[#76304A]">Payudara bengkak keras plus demam.</span> Tanda mastitis. Tetap susui dari payudara yang sakit dan segera periksa.</span></li>
    <li class="flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-[#EFD0D6]/20 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#3D2B30]/85"><span class="grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#9C3D5C] text-xs font-bold text-white">6</span><span data-en="One sided swollen leg with pain. Especially red hot calves. Watch for blood clots."><span class="font-bold text-[#76304A]">Kaki bengkak sebelah plus nyeri.</span> Terutama betis merah dan panas. Waspadai penggumpalan darah.</span></li>
    <li class="flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-[#EFD0D6]/20 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#3D2B30]/85"><span class="grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#9C3D5C] text-xs font-bold text-white">7</span><span data-en="Severe headache and blurry vision. Possible postpartum high blood pressure. Measure now."><span class="font-bold text-[#76304A]">Sakit kepala hebat dan pandangan kabur.</span> Bisa tanda tekanan darah tinggi pasca salin. Ukur tensi segera.</span></li>
    <li class="flex gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-[#EFD0D6]/20 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#3D2B30]/85"><span class="grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#9C3D5C] text-xs font-bold text-white">8</span><span data-en="Heavy sadness beyond 2 weeks. Especially thoughts of harming self or baby. A mental health emergency."><span class="font-bold text-[#76304A]">Sedih berat lebih dari 2 minggu.</span> Apalagi ada pikiran menyakiti diri atau bayi. Itu darurat kesehatan jiwa.</span></li>
  </ol>
  <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#3D2B30]/80"><span data-en="Need someone to talk to? Tell your partner or family, and read the">Butuh teman cerita? Ceritakan lelah ke pasangan atau keluarga, dan baca</span> <a class="font-semibold text-[#9C3D5C] underline" href="/artikel/baby-blues-vs-depresi-nifas">panduan baby blues vs depresi nifas</a>.</p>
</PilarLayout>
